### ============================================================
### 4. CLUBS
### ============================================================


### 4.1 Create Club
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/clubs
Authorization: Bearer {{clubAdminToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "name": "Programming Club",
  "description": "A club for programming and software development enthusiasts.",
  "category": "Technology",
  "logoUrl": "https://example.com/logo.png"
}

### Expected Response
# HTTP/1.1 201 Created
#
# {
#   "success": true,
#   "message": "Club created successfully",
#   "data": {
#     "id": "22222222-2222-2222-2222-222222222222",
#     "name": "Programming Club",
#     "description": "A club for programming and software development enthusiasts.",
#     "category": "Technology",
#     "ownerId": "11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111",
#     "isActive": true,
#     "createdAt": "2026-08-11T12:00:00Z"
#   }
# }


### 4.2 Get All Clubs
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/clubs

### Expected Response
